  message: "DONE — PR #538 (selfh/dev 8711a6c935). load_substrate adds a warn-first schema_version gate: an absent OR mismatched schema_version prints a stderr Warning but the map still loads (an older/newer map is usually still readable; rejecting would be over-strict). BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (live): 'symbols --input oldver.json' (schema_version='0.0.1-ancient') -> rc=0, stderr 'Warning: ...: substrate schema_version '0.0.1-ancient' differs from this build's '0.14.4'; field presence may not match.', AND symbols still emitted (12 lines stdout) (WAS: read silently with no signal). Control: a current-version map -> rc=0, empty stderr. Absent-version path warns 'no schema_version field; cannot verify ...'. Core 100% coverage."  # 301a
